Z||000009||87GTBro||07-26-2001||12:55 AM||||Be nice guys...  Not everybody knows that camaros and firebirds are the exact same car if you take the exterior panels and interior out.<P>The two cars are siblings... just like the Mercury Grand Marquis and the Ford Crown Victoria... the Dodge Stealth and the Mistubishi 3000GT... the Chevrolet Caprice and the Impala...<P>The factory does that to cut back on production costs.  Those vehicles use the same frame and some use the same engine.  But they have different exteriors and interiors which make them look like different cars...<P>Somebody correct me if I am wrong... but now you know...<P>------------------<BR>AOL IM: GTFiero86Dan<BR>'86 GT 4 speed<BR>'87 GT Auto<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/87GTBrosig1.gif"> ||||reg||1
